colaimdation
===========

A local WYSIWYG Markdown editor with an embedded MCP server, written in C++20
for Windows (Win32 + WebView2).

Licensing status
----------------

This repository is a self-contained application sample. No license has been
declared for the colaimdation source itself; treat it as "all rights reserved"
until the owner states otherwise.

Third-party components bundled under third_party/ keep their own licenses and
are redistributed unmodified:

  * Microsoft.Web.WebView2 SDK ....... Microsoft Software License Terms
                                       (see third_party/webview2/ after
                                        tools/fetch_webview2.ps1 has run)
  * Mermaid (mermaid.min.js) ......... MIT
  * KaTeX (katex.min.js, katex.min.css, fonts)
                                       MIT
  * highlight.js (highlight.min.js, themes)
                                       BSD-3-Clause

Each vendored package directory contains its upstream LICENSE file, and
third_party/vendor/VERSIONS.json records the exact version that was vendored.

The editor front-end under web/ is part of this repository and is covered by the
same terms as the rest of the source.
